        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BPRC100, Solid Brass Cabinet Knob 1 Inch Base Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDress up your <a href=\"/collections/deltana-cabinet-hardware\"><b>Deltana cabinet hardware</b></a> with this 1\" diameter decorative rosette (cabinet knob base plate). This traditionally styled rosette can be used behind cabinet pulls or cabinet knobs to add that extra dimension of style for a high-end look. Available in 8 different finish choices.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-BPRC100-size.gif?v=1704354605\" width=\"410\" height=\"184\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BPRC100 Base Plate Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana BPRC100 Base Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Diameter: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Traditional Styled Rosette</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BPRC100.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  BPRC100 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the plate will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>.\r\n</p>",
