                "title": "Solid Brass Cabinet Knob 1 Inch Decorative Base Plate | Deltana BPRC100",
                "description": "Solid Brass Cabinet Knob 1 Inch Base Plate Deltana BPRC100 - Dress up your Deltana cabinet hardware with this 1 inch diameter decorative rosette (cabinet knob base plate). This traditionally styled rosette can be used behind cabinet pulls or cabinet knobs to add that extra dimension of style for a high-end look. Available in 8 different finish choices.",
